<!doctype html>
<html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"/><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"/>
<title>60-90 Day Onboarding Checklist</title>
<style>:root{color-scheme:light dark}
body{margin:0 auto;max-width:52rem;padding:2rem 1.25rem;
font:16px/1.6 -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,"Segoe UI",Roboto,sans-serif;
color:#1b1b1b;background:#fff}
h1,h2,h3,h4,h5,h6{line-height:1.25;margin:2rem 0 .6rem}
h1{font-size:1.9rem} h2{font-size:1.45rem} h3{font-size:1.15rem}
p,ul,ol,blockquote,table,pre{margin:0 0 1rem}
code{font-family:ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace;font-size:.9em;
background:#f2f2f2;padding:.1em .3em;border-radius:3px}
pre{background:#f6f6f6;padding:.9rem 1rem;border-radius:5px;overflow-x:auto}
pre code{background:none;padding:0}
blockquote{border-left:3px solid #d0d0d0;margin-left:0;padding-left:1rem;
color:#4a4a4a}
table{border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;display:block;overflow-x:auto}
th,td{border:1px solid #ddd;padding:.4rem .6rem;text-align:left}
th{background:#f6f6f6}
hr{border:0;border-top:1px solid #ddd;margin:2rem 0}
a{color:#0b57d0}
@media(prefers-color-scheme:dark){
body{color:#e6e6e6;background:#151515}
code{background:#242424} pre{background:#1d1d1d}
th{background:#1d1d1d} th,td{border-color:#333}
blockquote{border-left-color:#3a3a3a;color:#b0b0b0} a{color:#8ab4f8}}</style></head>
<body>
<h1>60-90 Day Onboarding Checklist</h1>
<p><strong>Hire:</strong> {{ name }} <strong>Role:</strong> {{ title }} <strong>Manager:</strong> {{ name }} <strong>Day-30 review date:</strong> {{ date }}</p>
<hr/>
<h2>Days 31-60: Contributing Phase</h2>
<h3>Weeks 5-6: First Contributions</h3>
<ul><li>[ ] First project scope defined and agreed with manager (carryover from day-30 review).</li><li>[ ] Own first project actively in progress.</li><li>[ ] Participating actively in recurring ceremonies (contributing, not just attending).</li><li>[ ] Building cross-functional stakeholder relationships (target: 3-5 new contacts).</li><li>[ ] Identified one area for process or practice improvement.</li></ul>
<h3>Weeks 7-8: Building Momentum</h3>
<ul><li>[ ] First project completed; artifact created and shared (PR merged / doc published / milestone delivered).</li><li>[ ] Applied feedback from manager (visible behavior change or artifact).</li><li>[ ] Applied feedback from peer or cross-functional stakeholder.</li><li>[ ] Second project initiated or responsibility scope increased.</li><li>[ ] Day-60 check-in scheduled.</li></ul>
<h3>Day-60 Success Criteria (Gate to Execute Phase)</h3>
<ul><li>[ ] Completed first project successfully — artifact exists.</li><li>[ ] Received positive feedback from at least one team member (structured or unsolicited).</li><li>[ ] Works with minimal supervision on familiar tasks within role scope.</li><li>[ ] Demonstrates core job competencies at the expected level for role/level.</li><li>[ ] Goals for days 61-90 documented and agreed with manager.</li></ul>
<p><strong>Day-60 Review Outcome:</strong> [ ] Gate passed — proceed to Execute phase | [ ] Gate not passed — remediation plan:</p>
<hr/>
<h2>Days 61-90: Execute Phase</h2>
<h3>Weeks 9-10: Independence</h3>
<ul><li>[ ] Handling most responsibilities without requiring guidance for familiar tasks.</li><li>[ ] Major project or milestone in progress (defined at day-60 review).</li><li>[ ] Proactively identified and communicated at least one opportunity or risk.</li><li>[ ] Contributing to team planning activities.</li><li>[ ] Day-45 skip-level completed (if not already scheduled — schedule now).</li></ul>
<h3>Weeks 11-12: Full Performance</h3>
<ul><li>[ ] Major project or milestone delivered — artifact exists.</li><li>[ ] Working autonomously on 80%+ of responsibilities.</li><li>[ ] Development plan for next quarter drafted and reviewed with manager.</li><li>[ ] 90-day review scheduled.</li><li>[ ] Onboarding satisfaction survey sent to hire.</li></ul>
<h3>Day-90 Success Criteria (Formal Review)</h3>
<ul><li>[ ] Meets or exceeds performance expectations on primary responsibilities.</li><li>[ ] Works autonomously 80%+ of time without guidance.</li><li>[ ] Major project delivered with verifiable artifact.</li><li>[ ] Development plan for Q+1 agreed with manager.</li><li>[ ] Integrated into team culture — participates in social and professional rituals.</li></ul>
<p><strong>Day-90 Review Outcome:</strong> [ ] Standard performance cycle begins | [ ] Extended ramp — formal PIP or extended review:</p>
<hr/>
<h2>Check-In Log</h2>
<table><thead><tr><th>Date</th><th>Type</th><th>Key Themes</th><th>Actions</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td></td><td>Day-45 skip-level</td><td></td><td></td></tr><tr><td></td><td>Day-60 review</td><td></td><td></td></tr><tr><td></td><td>Day-90 review</td><td></td><td></td></tr></tbody></table>
</body></html>
